<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-FOCUS-BHP sees copper opportunities.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FOCUS-BHP sees copper opportunities.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Broken Hill Proprietary Co Ltd (BHP), the world's second largest copper producer, said on Tuesday it still saw profitable opportunities in the copper industry despite its first quarter loss from the Magma Copper operation.</p>
<p>BHP chairman Brian Loton told shareholders at the annual meeting that the steel and resources giant, which is Australia's largest company in terms of market capitalisation, was also looking at all options for its steel facilities.</p>
</text>
